SUMMARY:Cyrille Aimée
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Waterfront Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. French-American vocalist Cyrille Aimée grew up near Samois-sur-Seine\, the French town famous for its annual Django Reinhardt festival\, and her singing carries traces of that gypsy-jazz swing alongside modern jazz phrasing.
